.FIRE WEATHER...
Issued at 1228 PM PDT Fri Oct 16 2026

Conditions will remain very dry, with RH values around 10-20%
forecast for the rest of the day and poor overnight recoveries
tonight into Saturday. These conditions, combined with warmer
weather, will lead to near critical weather conditions for the
higher elevations of the Bay Area and Central Coast through
Saturday. We will begin to see a reprieve in conditions Saturday
into Sunday, as the upper level pattern shifts to broad troughing.
Temperatures become more seasonal and we should start to winds
become onshore, improving RH conditions as well.

